The world grows old as you stand through the ages. To you, time is different.

Reduces the time remaining on detrimental effects by [2, 5, 7, 9, 10 (TL1-5)], most cooling down talents by [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)], and increases the time remaining on beneficial effects by [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] (up to 2 times the current duration).
